-zh\" lang=\"en\">He&#x27;s in charge of administration at the hospital.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">運河</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うんが</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">运河；水道</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141146\"><ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパナマ<ruby>運河<rp>(</rp><rt>うんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The ship went through the Panama Canal.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うんざり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厌倦；厌烦；感到厌烦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230980\">あの<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはうんざりする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The kid is a pain in the neck.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">運送</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うんそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">运输；货运；搬运</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">運賃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うんちん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span cla